    "updated_at": "2021-04-09T23:12:54Z",
    "body": "Twitch is going to start public experiments for Chrome viewers using this video underflow behavior. It lets us reduce the buffer size for lower latency with less downside, as video underflow is less invasive for the viewer compared to buffering. The reception internally has been great so far, and we would love to see this behavior added to MSE for other browsers too.",
